I don't want to exchange.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"no_choice"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"chosen":["^Good luck on your journey. ","#","^speaker:Mysterious Witch ","/#","#","^voice:WitchChosen","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"no_choice":["^That's a shame, but I wish you good luck on your journey anyway. ","#","^speaker:Mysterious Witch ","/#","#","^voice:WitchNoChoice","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"MysteriousHunter":[["ev",{"VAR?":"MysteriousHunterCompletedFirstMeet"},false,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Hello my friend, it seems you're new here. ","#","^speaker:Captain of the brave warriors ","/#","#","^voice:CaptainFirstMeet","/#","\n","^So I think you should get used to some things here. ","#","^speaker:Captain of the brave warriors ","/#","#","^voice:CaptainFirstMeet","/#","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"MysteriousHunterCompletedFirstMeet","re":true},{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n","^I have a little challenge for you. ","#","^speaker:Captain of the brave warriors ","/#","#","^voice:CaptainDefault","/#","\n","^Overcome it, and I will reward you handsomely. ","#","^speaker:Captain of the brave warriors ","/#","#","^voice:CaptainDefault","/#","\n","ev","str","^Accept the challenge","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Refuse the challenge","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev","str","^Fish","/str",{"x()":"TriggerMiniGame","exArgs":1},"pop","/ev","\n","^Haha, well done, my friend. Keep trying! ","#","^speaker:Captain of the brave warriors ","/#","#","^voice:CaptainAcceptChallenge","/#","\n",{"->":"MysteriousHunter_challenge_end"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^It seems you're still not confident enough. ","#","^speaker:Captain of the brave warriors ","/#","#","^voice:CaptainRefuseChallenge","/#","\n","^Keep practicing, and I'll challenge you again next time. ","#","^speaker:Captain of the brave warriors ","/#","#","^voice:CaptainRefuseChallenge","/#","\n","end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"MysteriousHunter_challenge_end":["^Good job, my friend. Here's a small reward for your efforts. ","#","^speaker:Captain of the brave warriors ","/#","#","^voice:CaptainAcceptChallenge","/#","\n","^Hopefully, these runes will be helpful on your journey. ","#","^speaker:Captain of the brave warriors ","/#","#","^voice:CaptainAcceptChallenge","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"MysteriousHero":[["ev",{"VAR?":"MysteriousHeroCompletedFistMeet"},false,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Hello, I heard there's a new person here, so it turns out it's you! ","#","^speaker:Mysterious Hunter ","/#","#","^voice:HunterFirstMeet","/#","\n","^There are so many traps out there. I can't let a newcomer with unknown abilities go out there and throw themselves to their death. ","#","^speaker:Mysterious Hunter ","/#","#","^voice:HunterFirstMeet","/#","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"MysteriousHeroCompletedFistMeet","re":true},{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n","^I have a challenge: catch a BamBear and bring it back here, and I will acknowledge your abilities. ","#","^speaker:Mysterious Hunter ","/#","#","^voice:HunterDefault","/#","\n","ev","str","^Accept the challenge","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Refuse the challenge","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev","str","^Beast","/str",{"x()":"TriggerMiniGame","exArgs":1},"pop","/ev","\n","^That's great, do your best! ","#","^speaker:Mysterious Hunter ","/#","#","^voice:HunterAcceptChallenge","/#","\n",{"->":"MysteriousHero_challenge_end"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Don't be ashamed for backing down. I understand that in this chaotic world, everyone puts their own life first. ","#","^speaker:Mysterious Hunter ","/#","#","^voice:HunterRefuseChallenge","/#","\n","^But always remember to strive to improve your strength so you can protect yourself. ","#","^speaker:Mysterious Hunter ","/#","#","^voice:HunterRefuseChallenge","/#","\n","end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"MysteriousHero_challenge_end":["^Well done, brave warrior. This is your reward for your efforts. ","#","^speaker:Mysterious Hunter ","/#","#","^voice:HunterAcceptChallenge","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"TAE":["ev",{"VAR?":"hasMeetTAE"},false,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Greetings, one from the other dimension! ","#","^speaker:??? ","/#","#","^voice:TAEFirstMeet","/#","\n","^Allow me to introduce myself, I am <color=#EEC15F>The Anti-absolute Entity</color>, the one who summoned you from the other side of the universe. ","#","^speaker:??? ","/#","#","^voice:TAEFirstMeet","/#","\n","^As you can see, this world is being invaded by monsters everywhere, so we need to summon heroes from the other side of the universe to help us fight against them. ","#","^speaker:The Anti-absolute Entity ","/#","#","^voice:TAEFirstMeet","/#","\n","^You, who have proven yourself worthy of the favor of <color=#EEC15F>Quantum Bridge</color>, I hope you will strive to fight with all your might on this journey. ","#","^speaker:The Anti-absolute Entity ","/#","#","^voice:TAEFirstMeet","/#","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hasMeetTAE","re":true},{"->":"TAE.6"},null]}],"nop","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"Ending":["^You have gone too far, you wretched fiend. ","#","^speaker:Salesman ","/#","#","^voice:Ending ","/#","#","^cam:cam1","/#","\n","^Ha ha… A fallen god like you still dares to look down on me? ","#","^speaker:The Anti-absolute Entity ","/#","#","^voice:Ending ","/#","#","^cam:cam2","/#","\n","^Remember who it was that defeated you, The Absolute One. ","#","^speaker:The Anti-absolute Entity ","/#","#","^voice:Ending ","/#","#","^cam:cam2","/#","\n","^You may have defeated me… but thanks to this brave soul’s resilience, I have regained my strength. ","#","^speaker:Salesman ","/#","#","^voice:Ending ","/#","#","^cam:cam1","/#","\n","^Wait, what? How could that hero possibly reach this place?! ","#","^speaker:The Anti-absolute Entity ","/#","#","^voice:Ending ","/#","#","^cam:cam2","/#","\n","^With the Sigils they have gathered and brought here. “O my power… rise once more!” ","#","^speaker:Salesman ","/#","#","^voice:Ending ","/#","#","^cam:cam1","/#","\n","^No… no! How could an eternal god like me be defeated like this?! No… these wars… must not… be allowed to… end… Aaaahhhhh…! ","#","^speaker:The Anti-absolute Entity ","/#","#","^voice:Ending ","/#","#","^cam:cam2","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"global decl":["ev",false,{"VAR=":"hasBloodFang"},0,{"VAR=":"currentRune"},false,{"VAR=":"hasMeetTAE"},false,{"VAR=":"MysteriousWitchCompletedFirstMeet"},false,{"VAR=":"TheSalesmanCompletedFirstMeet"},false,{"VAR=":"MysteriousHunterCompletedFirstMeet"},false,{"VAR=":"MysteriousHeroCompletedFistMeet"},"/ev","end",null],"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}